hing with your fingers! <EOL><br><BR> <EOL>Agate (a semi-precious stone) is widely available as a polishing stone but it has the single disadvantage of absorbing moisture from the atmosphere. Pencil and dog-tooth burnishers made of agate are perfectly adequate for almost all gilding projects. A dog tooth burnisher (No. 17 is a reasonable size) is sufficient to start with and perhaps a pencil burnisher (No. 8). The hematite burnisher is a very versatile tool particularly for raised gilding. <EOL><br><BR> <EOL><b>Tips</b><Br> <EOL> Always store the burnisher in a soft cloth or felt pouch (not supplied) and never put it into your pencil box or leave it lying on the desk -- the smallest of scratches will gradually build up and cause the burnisher to ""pull."" Cleanliness is vital -- nearly everybody wants to ""feel"" the smooth stone and leave an invisible layer of grease with their fingers -- don't let anyone touch it! Before working breathe on the burnisher and polish it with a piece of silk. <EOL><br><BR> <EOL><b>How To Use</b><br> <EOL>Burnish with slow, moderately applied pressure, using strokes about 2 cm (an inch) wide. The correct amount of pressure comes with practice and experience. Too little pressure will not yield a high sheen. Too much pressure will rub off the leaf.",,0,0,N,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,8459,Uncategorized/Natural Pigments,,28.300,,Thursday 11 November 2010 09:04:14 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,282,,29,0,N,33,Natural Pigments
54219,NAP-300-AU2.0SFCP,bhavesh2,"Aurum Composition Leaf No. 2.0 (Book): 25 Leaves, Made in USA by Natural Pigments",Aurum Composition Leaf No. 2.0 (Book): 25 Leaves by Natural Pigments,0.010,5.800,5.800,,"Aurum Composition Leaf No. 2.0 (Book)<bR><br> <EOL><b>About Aurum Composition Leaf</b><br> <EOL>Aurum composition leaf is our brand of high-quality leaf manufactured specifically in the colors and weights that are standard in the industry. Different varieties of leaf, including diferent colors and metals, are packaged in boxes of 20 books each. This leaf is produced using the latest technology and respected traditions of the gold beating craft.<br><BR> <EOL> <EOL>Aurum composition leaf is imitation gold leaf made from brass, a combination of 88% copper and 12% zinc. The high copper content of No. 2 gives it a deep red gold tone.<br><BR> <EOL> <EOL>The copper alloy in metal leaf will tarnish, therefore all metal leaf must be sealed to prevent tarnishing, except aluminum leaf. It is best to wear gloves when handling metal leaf to avoid leaving finger prints and other residues that may cause the leaf to discolor under the sealer. <EOL><br><BR> <EOL>A book of loose composition leaf is assembled by placing each unit of composition leaf between sheets of thin rouged paper. The gilder can then remove one leaf at a time without disturbing the remaining leaves. It is removed from the book with a gilder's tip, a flat natural hair brush, or tongs. <EOL><br><BR> <EOL>Our composition leaf is made in the standard European size of 140 x 140 mm (5.5 x 5.5 inches) and is available in units called ""books,"" each book containing 25 leaves. For volume discounts order one or more boxes of composition leaf; each box contains 20 books or 500 leaves and covers 105 sq. ft. without waste or overlap. The percentage of waste is based on the complexity of the object and the gilder's expertise in laying leaf. If the surface is very ornate with deep crevices it will take more leaf than the same size area of a flat surface.",,0,3,N,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,8459,Uncategorized/Natural Pigments,,6.220,,Thursday 11 November 2010 07:08:55 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,282,,5.800,0,N,33,Natural Pigments
54220,NAP-300-AU2.0SFCPPK,bhavesh2,"Aurum Composition Leaf No. 2.0 (Pack): 20 Books, 500 Leaves, Made in USA by Natural Pigments","Aurum Composition Leaf No. 2.0 (Pack): 20 Books, 500 Leaves",0.040,76,76,,"Aurum Composition Leaf No. 2.0 (Pack): 20 Books, 500 Leaves<bR><br> <EOL><b>About Aurum Composition Leaf</b><br> <EOL>Aurum composition leaf is our own brand of high-quality metal leaf manufactured specifically in the colors and weights that are standard in the industry. Different varieties of leaf, including diferent colors and metals, are packaged in boxes of 20 books each. This leaf is produced using the latest technology and respected traditions of the gold beating craft.<br><BR> <EOL> <EOL>Aurum composition leaf is imitation gold leaf made from brass, a combination of 88% copper and 12% zinc. The high copper content of No. 2 gives it a deep red gold tone. <EOL><br><BR> <EOL>The copper alloy in metal leaf will tarnish, therefore all metal leaf must be sealed to prevent tarnishing, except aluminum leaf. It is best to wear gloves when handling metal leaf to avoid leaving finger prints and other residues that may cause the leaf to discolor under the sealer. <EOL><br><BR> <EOL>A book of loose composition leaf is assembled by placing each unit of composition leaf between sheets of thin rouged paper. The gilder can then remove one leaf at a time without disturbing the remaining leaves. It is removed from the book with a gilder's tip, a flat natural hair brush, or tongs. <EOL><br><BR> <EOL>Our gold leaf is made in the standard European size of 140 x 140 mm (5.5 x 5.5 inches) and is available in units called ""books,"" each book containing 25 leaves. For volume discounts order one or more boxes of composition leaf; each box contains 20 books or 500 leaves and covers 105 sq. ft. without waste or overlap. The percentage of waste is based on the complexity of the object and the gilder's expertise in laying leaf. If the surface is very ornate with deep crevices it will take more leaf than the same size area of a flat surface. <EOL><Br><BR> <EOL><b>Pack of 20 books, each book contains 25 leaves, 500 leaves total.</b>",,0,1,N,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,8459,Uncategorized/Natural Pigments,,73.300,,Thursday 11 November 2010 07:18:22 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,282,,76,0,N,33,Natural Pigments
54196,NAP-300-AU23.5SFB,bhavesh,Aurum Gold Leaf 23.5 Kt Loose (Book) Made in USA by Natural Pigments,Aurum Gold Leaf 23.5 Kt Loose (Book) Made in USA by Natural Pigments,0.010,39.800,39.800,,"Aurum Gold Leaf 23.5 Kt Loose (Book)<bR><br> <EOL><b>About Aurum Gold</b><BR> <EOL>Aurum gold leaf is our own brand of high quality leaf product. This leaf is manufactured specifically in the colors and weights that are standard in the industry. Different varieties of leaf, including double weight and silver, are packaged in the distinctive Aurum red box (pack of 20 books). This leaf is produced using the latest technology and respected traditions of the gold beating craft. <EOL><br><BR> <EOL>A book of loose gold leaf is assembled by placing each unit of gold leaf between sheets of thin rouged paper. The gilder can then remove one leaf at a time without disturbing the remaining leaves. It is removed from the book with a gilder's tip, a flat natural hair brush. <EOL><br><BR> <EOL>Our gold leaf is made in the standard European size of 80 x 80 mm (3.15 x 3.15 inches) and is available in units called ""books,"" each book containing 25 leaves. For volume discounts order one or more boxes of gold leaf; each box contains 20 books or 500 leaves.<bR><BR> <EOL> <EOL><b>Loose 23.5 karat gold leaf, Average weight: 15 grams per 1,000 leaves, Book of 25 leaves</b> <EOL>",,0,1,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,8459,Uncategorized/Natural Pigments,,51.540,,Thursday 11 November 2010 05:50:32 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,282,,39.800,0,N,33,Natural Pigments
