per towel to remove any dust. Apply gesso, acrylic dispersion primer or oil primer directly to surface. If surface is too absorbent, apply a light coat of Sealing Varnish before applying gesso, acrylic dispersion primer or oil primer. To improve adhesion, it is best to lightly sand the panel face before applying the primer. For best results, apply Sealing Varnish or paint to edges and back to reduce moisture absorption. <EOL>",,1000000,0,N,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,8459,Uncategorized/Natural Pigments,,23.960,,Wednesday 10 November 2010 06:08:34 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,282,,10.530,0,N,33,Natural Pigments
