53504,KOL-702-5234006,ariel2,Kolibri Mop Brush # 10 (Made in Germany),Kolibri Mop Brush # 10 (Made in Germany),0.060,9.640,9.640,,Kolibri Mop Brush # 10<br><Br> <EOL><b>Specifications:</b><Br> <EOL>* Brush Type: Mop<br> <EOL>* Hair Type: Goat and pony mixture<bR> <EOL>* Ferrule: Nickel-plated brass<br> <EOL>* Size: 10<br> <EOL>* Hair Width: 3.8 cm (1.5 in.)<br> <EOL>* Hair Length: 3.8 cm (1.5 in.)<br> <EOL>* Handle Length including ferrule: 18.4 cm (7.25 in.)<br><br> <EOL> <EOL><b>About Mop Brush</b><BR> <EOL>This mop brush is made from a mixture of pony and goat hair that is 1.9 cm (0.75 inch) out of the ferrule. The brush has a seamless nickel-plated brass ferrule on silver polished wood handle. <EOL><br><bR> <EOL><b>Painting</b><br> <EOL>The mop brush is ideal for washes and broad applications of paint. The large head of soft natural hair holds an immense volume of paint that can easily be drawn across paper or gesso surface. <EOL><br><BR> <EOL><b>Gilding</b><Br> <EOL>This brush makes an ideal duster for gilding to remove pieces of gold leaf or to dust off the gilding base before applying the leaf. The soft hairs of this brush will not scratch the gilding base or the gold once applied.,,0,4,N,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,8459,Uncategorized/Natural Pigments,,10.950,,Wednesday 03 November 2010 07:10:09 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,280,,5.010,0,N,33,Natural Pigments
