lor brushes due to its strength, spring and ability to retain its shape (sometimes called ""snap""). It holds a very fine point or edge. This is considered a professional grade of hair, and if properly cared for, Kolinsky will last for many years. <EOL><br><BR> <EOL>The Natural Pigments Kolinsky Series brushes are made in Russia and sized with the European system which begins with 0. An English size 6 watercolor round is equivalent to a European size 7 Natural Pigments brush. <EOL>",,0,1,N,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,8459,Uncategorized/Natural Pigments,,38.930,,Tuesday 02 November 2010 06:17:14 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,280,,17.820,0,N,33,Natural Pigments
