g</b><BR> <EOL>Barite absorbs 11 grams of oil per 100 grams of pigment. It readily mixes with oil and water to form a smooth paste.<BR><BR> <EOL><B>Toxicity</b><BR> <EOL>Although barite contains a ""heavy"" metal (barium), it is not considered a toxic chemical by most governments because of its extreme insolubility. Care, however, should be used in handling the dry powder pigment to avoid breathing the dust.",,999999,1,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,8878,Uncategorized/Natural Pigments/Pigment Powders/Rublev Colors 500 g (1.1 lb) Pingment Powders,,16.720,,Saturday 04 December 2010 08:31:04 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,282,,12.500,0,N,33,Natural Pigments
