55506,NAP-820-3102,bhavesh,Rublev Colours Chrome Yellow Primrose 50 ml (1.69 fl oz) Tube,Rublev Colours Chrome Yellow Primrose 50 ml (1.69 fl oz) Tube,0.040,22.500,22.500,,"Rublev Colours Chrome Yellow Primrose 50 ml (1.69 fl oz) Tube<BR><br> <EOL><b>Specifications:</b><BR> <EOL><B>Common Names:</b><BR> <EOL>* English: chrome yellow<br> <EOL>* French: jaune de chrôme<br> <EOL>* German: Chromgelb<BR> <EOL>* Italian: giallo de cromo<BR><BR> <EOL> <EOL><b>Color Information</b><BR> <EOL>* Single Pigment: Chrome Yellow Primrose<BR> <EOL>* Binder: Linseed Oil<br><br> <EOL> <EOL><B>Pigment Information</b><BR> <EOL>* Color: Yellow<BR> <EOL>* Colour Index: Pigment Yellow 34 <br> <EOL>* Chemical Name: Lead Chromate/Lead Sulfate<BR> <EOL>* Chemical Formula: PbCrO<sub>4</sub>• PbSO<sub>4</sub><BR><BR> <EOL> <EOL><b>Properties</b><BR> <EOL>* ASTM Lightfastness: Not Rated<br> <EOL>* Opacity: Opaque<BR> <EOL>* Tinting Strength: Average<br> <EOL>* Drying Rate: Fast<br><br> <EOL> <EOL><b>About Chrome Yellow Primrose </b><BR> <EOL>Chrome Yellow Primrose is lead chromate/lead sulfate, obtained synthetically as a yellow crystalline powder by precipitation from a solution of a lead salt. Chrome yellow primrose has good hiding power with bright yellow hue and average tinting strength. <EOL><BR><bR> <EOL><B>Note:</b> Colors swatches are shown on the left in mass tone from the tube, mixed with oil at center, and mixed with an equal amount of white on the right. All pictures of color swatches in this web site are only approximations of the actual color of the oil paint. We taken every care to match the color in these pictures on calibrated color monitors to the actual color. However, because of the wide variance in color monitors the results you get may vary.<BR><BR> <EOL> <EOL><b><Font Color=red>WARNING: HARMFUL IF SWALLOWED OR BY SKIN CONTACT. Contains Lead Chromate/Lead Sulfate. Avoid ingestion and skin contact. Wear protective clothing and gloves to prevent contact with broken skin. Never use near children or pets. Conforms to ASTM D 4236.</font></b> <EOL>",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,8804,Uncategorized/Natural Pigments/Paints/Rublev Colours 50 ml (1.7 fl oz) Tubes,,20.320,,Thursday 18 November 2010 10:48:22 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,282,,16.880,0,N,33,Natural Pigments
