r is considered non-toxic, however, manganese, a constituent of umber, is considered moderately toxic, so care should be exercised when handling the dry powder pigment so as not to inhale the dust.",,1000000,1,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,8459,Uncategorized/Natural Pigments,,7.090,,Friday 03 December 2010 06:06:07 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,282,,5.210,0,N,33,Natural Pigments
55869,NAP-820-6152,bhavesh,Rublev Colours Cyprus Raw Umber Dark 50 ml (1.69 fl oz) Tube,Rublev Colours Cyprus Raw Umber Dark 50 ml (1.69 fl oz) Tube,0.040,12.950,12.950,,"Rublev Colours Cyprus Raw Umber Dark 50 ml (1.69 fl oz) Tube<BR><br> <EOL><b>Specifications:</b><BR> <EOL><B>Common Names:</b><BR> <EOL>* English: Umber<BR> <EOL>* French: Ombre<BR> <EOL>* German: Umbra<BR> <EOL>* Italian: Ombra<BR> <EOL>* Russian:Умбра<BR> <EOL>* Spanish: Ombra<BR> <EOL><BR> <EOL><b>Color Information</b><BR> <EOL>* Single Pigment: Natural Iron-Manganese Oxide<BR> <EOL>* Binder: Linseed Oil<br><br> <EOL> <EOL><B>Pigment Information</b><BR> <EOL>* Color: Brown<BR> <EOL>* Colour Index: Pigment Brown 7 (77491) (77492) (77499)<br> <EOL>* Chemical Name: Natural Iron Manganese Oxide<BR> <EOL>* Chemical Formula: Fe<sub>2</sub>O<sub>3</sub>MnO<sub>2</sub> <EOL><BR><BR> <EOL> <EOL><b>Properties</b><BR> <EOL>* ASTM Lightfastness: I<br> <EOL>* Opacity: Semi-Transparent<BR> <EOL>* Tinting Strength: Good<br> <EOL>* Drying Rate: Average<br><br> <EOL> <EOL><b>About Cyprus Raw Umber Dark</b><BR> <EOL>Rublev Colours Cyprus Raw Umber Dark is a semi-transparent brown with good tinting strength, medium grained and, like most Rublev Oil Colours, brushes ""long"" in the direction of the brush stroke. Our Italian Cyprus Raw Umber Light is from Cyprus. <EOL><BR><BR> <EOL><B>Note:</b><BR>Colors swatches are shown in mass tone, straight from the tube, on the left, and mixed with an equal amount of Titanium white on the right. All pictures of color swatches in this web site are only approximations of the actual color of the oil paint. We taken every care to match the color in these pictures on calibrated color monitors to the actual color. However, because of the wide variance in color monitors the results you get may vary.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,57728,Painting and Painting Accessories/Raw Materials/Pigments,,13.090,,Saturday 20 November 2010 08:07:43 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,282,,9.710,