cols.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,8459,Uncategorized/Natural Pigments,,135.460,,Saturday 04 December 2010 07:40:53 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,282,,114,0,N,33,Natural Pigments
