form a smooth paste.<BR><BR> <EOL><B>Toxicity</b><BR> <EOL>Vicenza earth is not considered to be toxic, however, care should be used in handling the dry powder pigment to avoid breathing the dust.",,1000000,0,N,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,8459,Uncategorized/Natural Pigments,,34.080,,Saturday 04 December 2010 09:15:21 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,282,,15.600,0,N,33,Natural Pigments
