53934,NAP-900-10TS,rommel,Thin Silverpoint Stylus: Made in USA by Natural Pigments,Thin Silverpoint Stylus: Made in USA by Natural Pigments,0.500,18,18,," <EOL>* Thin Silverpoint Stylus is a 50 mm (2 in) long handmade, dead-soft pure silver (99.9%) point shaped to a cone on one end, polished, and set in a 0.9 mm metal holder.<br /><br> <EOL><b> The stylus can be used with the following points:</b><br /> <EOL>* Sterling Silverpoint (Thin, Dead-soft)<br /> <EOL>* Sterling Silverpoint (Thin, Half-hard)<br /> <EOL>* Copper point (Thin, Dead-soft)<br /> <EOL>* Brass point (Thin, Dead-soft)",,0,24,N,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,8551,Uncategorized/Natural Pigments/Drawing Tools and Supplies/Drawing Points 0.9 mm,,23.980,,Tuesday 09 November 2010 10:15:48 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,282,,18,0,N,33,Natural Pigments
