58254,NAP-621-JARP1OZ,bhavesh,"Wide Mouth Plastic 1 oz (30 ml) Jar, Made in USA by Natural Pigments",Wide Mouth Plastic 1 oz (30 ml) Jar with Black Lid,0.060,0.950,0.950,,"<B>Wide Mouth Plastic 1 oz (30 ml) Jar with Black Lid</b><BR><BR> <EOL><B>About Wide Mouth Plastic Jar</b><BR> <EOL>This attractive wide mouth jar resists oxygen permeation and has good water barrier characertistics. The clear round PET plastic jar is supplied with a black screw-on cap with PVC liner. It is ideal for storing approximately 50 grams of mineral pigment or 10 grams of organic pigment. Also, great for storing small quantities of wet dispersed pigment.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,8932,Uncategorized/Natural Pigments/Tools,,0.970,,Friday 10 December 2010 09:06:42 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,282,,0.710,0,N,33,Natural Pigments
