53937,NAP-900-10WS,rommel,Wide Silverpoint Stylus: Made in USA by Natural Pigments,Wide Silverpoint Stylus: Made in USA by Natural Pigments,0.500,18,18,," <EOL>* Wide Silverpoint Stylus is a 50 mm (2 in) long handmade dead-soft, pure silver (99.9 %) point shaped to cone on one end and a bevel on the other, polished, and set in a 2 mm metal holder.<br /><br> <EOL><b> The stylus can be used with the following points:</b><br /> <EOL>* Sterling Silverpoint (Wide, Dead-soft)<br /> <EOL>* Sterling Silverpoint (Wide, Half-hard)<br /> <EOL>* Copper point (Wide, Dead-soft)<br /> <EOL>* Brass point (Wide, Dead-soft)",,999992,6,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,8577,Uncategorized/Natural Pigments/Drawing Tools and Supplies/Drawing Points 2 mm,,24.640,,Tuesday 09 November 2010 10:19:33 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,282,,18,0,N,33,Natural Pigments
